  "decision_conditions": [
    "The single storey rear extension would by reason of its design and scale appear unduly excessive and would fail to relate sympathetically or subordinately to the main dwelling, appearing overly dominant and adversely altering the character and appearance of the application site and the surrounding area. The proposed development is therefore contrary to the aims and objectives of Policy 28 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018 and Supplementary Planning Document 4 - 'Design of Residential Extensions'.",
    "The single storey rear extension would by reason of its excessive depth and proximity to the shared side boundary lines, result in an adverse impact on the occupiers of 61 Sparrow Farm Road in terms of loss of light, loss of outlook and sense of enclosure. The proposed development is therefore contrary to Policy 29 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018 and guidance set out in SPD4 'Design of Residential Extensions'."
